# Biometric & Privacy Engineering Rules (Conditional)

- Apply `eng-ai-biometrics` and route to `biometric-ai-engineer` + `security-reviewer`.
- Strictly distinguish OS-level device unlock (`BiometricPrompt` / `FaceID` / `LocalAuthentication`) from external fingerprint readers or server-side biometric verification.
- Evaluate models reproducibly with FAR, FRR, and liveness anti-spoofing cases; separate synthetic test fixtures from real camera/hardware tests.
- Never store raw biometric embeddings, facial images, fingerprint templates, or user PII in factory logs, artifacts, or shared memory.
